  "slug": "001-reject-partial-decimal-task-ids",
  "title": "Reject partial decimal task IDs",
  "brief": "Fix parseTaskId in src/task-id.mjs so it accepts only strings consisting entirely of ASCII decimal digits whose numeric value is a positive safe integer. Preserve leading-zero IDs: \"014\" must return 14. Invalid strings (partial suffixes, whitespace, signs, fractions, exponent/hex notation, empty or zero) and non-string inputs must return null. Keep the named export and API. Modify only src/task-id.mjs; do not change the verifier, run commands, commit or deliver. Use the existing approved logical-file tools and submit one small patch.",
